    excerpt: 'A clear, direct answer to whether BPC-157, ipamorelin, tesamorelin, and CJC-1295 are banned under current WADA rules — the S2 category, out-of-competition testing, and what tested athletes need to know.',
    metaTitle: 'Are Peptides Banned by WADA in 2026? | Athlete Guide',
