    title: 'Small-Group Personal Training vs. One-on-One Personal Training in Charleston: Cost, Results, and the Right Fit',
    excerpt: 'A local decision guide comparing small-group and one-on-one personal training in Charleston — real cost differences, who gets better results from each format, and how to actually choose.',
    metaTitle: 'Small-Group vs. One-on-One Training Charleston | Cost Guide',
